      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回要与<a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a>一起使用的参数，以便通过一个<a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>解析此异常的“detail”问题。",
      "count": 1
