    {
      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>. The arguments are expanded\ninto placeholders of the message value, for example, \"Invalid content type {0}\".",
